SUMMARY:🚗 Road Trip to Niagara Falls – Nikki Glaser Live. Now free!
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Movies & Social Group - Celebrating 14 Years!\n# 🚗 
 Road Trip to Niagara Falls – Nikki Glaser Live! 🎤😂\n\nJoin us for 
 a fun late-night road trip to Niagara Falls to see **Nikki Glaser** live a
 t the beautiful OLG Stage at Fallsview Casino Resort!\n\n**💲 Cost: Just
  $0 \, yes free! My way to give back to the group!**\n\n**Transportation:*
 *\n\nI'm taking the 6PM \, $50 Safeway Tours bus departing from Broadview 
 /Gerrard. You get $40 back at casino in playable credit\n\nhttps://safeway
 tours.net/casino\n\nYou can take bus too or make your own way . As long as
  you're able to meet me at the casino before the show.\n\n### Schedule\n\n
 *\n* 🎭 **Showtime:** **10:30 PM** (Late Show)\n*\n\nNikki Glaser is one
  of today's top stand-up comedians\, known for her brutally honest\, fearl
 ess comedy and appearances on HBO\, Netflix\, Comedy Central\, and *The Ro
 ast of Tom Brady*. Expect a hilarious night filled with sharp observations
 \, quick wit\, and plenty of laughs.\n\n🎟️ Space is limited\, so don'
 t wait!\n\n**Event information:**\n[https://fallsviewcasinoresort.com/even
 ts-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/nikki-glaser.html](https://fallsviewc
 asinoresort.com/events-and-promotions/schedule-of-events/nikki-glaser.html
 )\n\nNOTE - only 4 spots total for this. Please sign up if 100% certain yo
 u'll be able to attend.
